      "section": "5.4.1",
      "label": "[REQ-1-OAD-9356]",
      "text": "The CSW shall allow integration of low-level hardware or vendor-software subsystems by providing TMT-standardized software Hardware Control Daemons for these systems (see [REQ-1-OAD-9365]).",
